{%- comment -%}
GUIDELINES FOR AI ASSISTANT — VIKUNJA TASKS PLUGIN
=====================================================

ARCHITECTURE PREFERENCES:
- Framework: v3.x (full color support available but prefer grayscale for clarity)
- Target 4 layout variations: full, half_horizontal, half_vertical, quadrant
- Big screens (TRMNL X): use responsive sizing (lg: prefixes) to scale up
- Keep all common code here — title_bar, shared CSS, data prep
- Individual views should only contain layout-specific markup
- Comment liberally — explain WHY, not just WHAT
- Keep code readable over clever

DATA STRUCTURE (from Vikunja API):
- `data` is an array of task objects
- Key fields: id, title, description, done (boolean), percent_done (0-1 decimal)
- Dates: due_date, start_date, end_date (all ISO strings, check for "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z")
- Relations: assignees (array), labels (null or array), project_id
- Display: hex_color (string), priority (number), position (number)

DATA PRIORITIES:
- Tasks sorted: most recent first (API returns in this order)
- percent_done: multiply by 100 for display (0.5 = 50%)
- due_date: only display if not "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" (Vikunja's "no date" value)
- assignees: show first assignee name if present

DISPLAY PATTERNS:
- Progress: prefer text percentage over progress bars (cleaner on e-ink)
- Dates: use relative when recent ("Today", "Tomorrow") if possible, else short date
- Task title: clamp to 1-2 lines depending on view size
- Index numbers: use `forloop.index` in meta section of item component

DON'T TOUCH:
- title_bar structure below — custom Vikunja logo is inline SVG
- title_bar stays in shared markup (used by all 4 views)
- The SVG logo is base64-encoded, don't modify unless replacing

CUSTOM PATTERNS IN USE:
- Due date validation: `{% unless task.due_date == "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" %}`
- Progress calc: `{{ task.percent_done | times: 100 | round: 0 }}%`
- Assignee display: `{{ task.assignees[0].name | default: "Unassigned" }}`

VIEW-SPECIFIC NOTES:
- full: show 6-8 tasks with descriptions
- half_horizontal: 3-4 tasks max, side-by-side layout preferred
- half_vertical: 4-6 tasks, stacked vertically
- quadrant: 2-3 tasks max, minimal details (title + percent only)

COLOR POLICY:
- Default to grayscale for maximum device compatibility
- hex_color field available but rarely set — don't rely on it
- If using color: prefer semantic labels (label--success for done, etc.)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}Shared title_bar component for all views{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture title_bar -%}
<div class="title_bar">
    <img class="image" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,">
    <span class="title">Vikunja</span>
    <span class="instance">{{ data | size }} open</span>
</div>
{%- endcapture -%}
